{"1448060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RADMINTON", "steam_appid": 1448060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1448060/extras/c82ea7ebd8384d2fa6e10e771f715fb3.webp?t=1780792351\" width=823 height=52 /></span><strong>3D-parkour action game</strong> where you play as <i><strong>Brad</strong></i>, a super awesome parkour thief who's just stolen big corpo's most prized possession, <i><strong>The Radminton</strong></i>.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape from chasing enemies in multiple levels using the Radminton racket and other pickups to deflect bullets, defeat enemies, and traverse levels.<br>Wall run, jump, bump, soar, and slide-</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A punk-funk action-packed parkour action game that's about being rebellious, sticking it to the man, and taking down that big evil corporation that- <i>owns the city?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1448060/extras/1ca4f750a126ca1e5bec597bbcf20451.webp?t=1780792351\" width=823 height=52 /></span>Customize your character, weapons, board, and style in a fun and expressive way- putting you in the shoes of a RadRunner to take down ADCO and take back the city.<br>Build your own parkour levels, setup your own missions, and take down ADCO your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1448060/extras/e9ed0c47a9e2109de667dcba00f684f1.webp?t=1780792351\" width=823 height=52 /></span>Party up with your crew and play a variety of fun party games such as RadRun, RadTag, or vibe with your crew in the playable and interactive lobby- hitting tricks and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for something more action-packed? Team-up in CO-OP PVE modes against the infamous ADCO personnel. Want to prove you're the most RAD of them all? Test your might in the arena in a variety of multiplayer modes such as Deathmatch, RadFlag, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1448060/extras/169c5323dab7f8baf3039885022c2721.webp?t=1780792351\" width=823 height=52 /></span> RADMINTON is a game rooted deep with a message of keeping it funky, real, and <strong>RAD.</strong><br><br> </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1448060/extras/c82ea7ebd8384d2fa6e10e771f715fb3.webp?t=1780792351\" width=823 height=52 /></span><strong>3D-parkour action game</strong> where you play as <i><strong>Brad</strong></i>, a super awesome parkour thief who's just stolen big corpo's most prized possession, <i><strong>The Radminton</strong></i>.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape from chasing enemies in multiple levels using the Radminton racket and other pickups to deflect bullets, defeat enemies, and traverse levels.<br>Wall run, jump, bump, soar, and slide-</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A punk-funk action-packed parkour action game that's about being rebellious, sticking it to the man, and taking down that big evil corporation that- <i>owns the city?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1448060/extras/1ca4f750a126ca1e5bec597bbcf20451.webp?t=1780792351\" width=823 height=52 /></span>Customize your character, weapons, board, and style in a fun and expressive way- putting you in the shoes of a RadRunner to take down ADCO and take back the city.<br>Build your own parkour levels, setup your own missions, and take down ADCO your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1448060/extras/e9ed0c47a9e2109de667dcba00f684f1.webp?t=1780792351\" width=823 height=52 /></span>Party up with your crew and play a variety of fun party games such as RadRun, RadTag, or vibe with your crew in the playable and interactive lobby- hitting tricks and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for something more action-packed? Team-up in CO-OP PVE modes against the infamous ADCO personnel. Want to prove you're the most RAD of them all? Test your might in the arena in a variety of multiplayer modes such as Deathmatch, RadFlag, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1448060/extras/169c5323dab7f8baf3039885022c2721.webp?t=1780792351\" width=823 height=52 /></span> RADMINTON is a game rooted deep with a message of keeping it funky, real, and <strong>RAD.</strong><br><br> </p>", "short_description": "Become a super rad parkour vigilante and fight back against ADCO. Experience over-the-top action and comical gunfights against 'the big corpo' as you traverse through movement-based levels and puzzles. A 3D-action parkour movement shooter where you can customize, style, rebel, and keep it RAD!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1448060/43c76f8f643b5c9b8ab769c4159b8e3f2d40b5ae/header.jpg?t=1780792351", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1448060/2b30a72a72122ff87e12056d7831f780ae758e5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780792351", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st